    17	    long_about = "EclipticRD v3 macOS screen streaming host.\n\nFirst run: macOS prompts for Screen Recording and Accessibility. Grant both in System Settings > Privacy & Security, then relaunch the host. Screen Recording is required for capture; Accessibility is required for remote input injection."
